{
  "title": "No Home",
  "description": "Hae-Jun Go, who ran from home, and Eun-Yeong Baek, the problem child who lives in a tent. These two, who met under terrible circumstances, are forced to live together in an abandoned dormitory. This is a story of difficult growth between two people who hate both the dorm and each other. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Boarding School, Bullying, Comedy, Delinquents, Drama, Estranged Family, Ghosts, Male Protagonist, School Clubs, Shounen, Slice of Life, Supernatural, Tragedy, 21st century, Abusive Family Member, Adapted to Anime, Award Winning, Boarding House, Cohabitation, Coming of Age, Dead Family Member, Depression, Dormitory, Ensemble Cast, Found Family, Full Color, Haunted Location, High School, Homeless, Korean Folklore, Longstrip, Male Lead, Manhwa, Non-BL with Two Male Leads, Poverty, Primarily Teen Cast, School, Seeing Things Other Humans Can't, South Korea, Trauma, Violent Male Lead, Violent Protagonist, Web Comic",
